{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Chromatic Breathing 是一款結合色彩漸變與引導呼吸的放鬆應用程式，適合忙碌中想舒緩焦慮、提升專注力或練習正念的使用者。目前在 App Store 限時免費，原價 US $0.99，有興趣的使用者可把握機會下載體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>多款呼吸節奏自由選擇</h2>\n<p>全屏色彩隨吸氣、屏息與呼氣週期平滑變化，提供 4-4-6、4-7-8、Box Breathing 等多種節奏，亦可自行調整各階段時長。使用者可挑選「Calm Ocean」、「Warm Sunset」預設主題或自訂配色，搭配自然流水聲營造氛圍，並透過統計掌握練習時長與完成次數，建立穩定的放鬆習慣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-330-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-331-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-332-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-333-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-334-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-335-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Chromatic Breathing</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T15:40:12.196475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}